<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka three, 12-month T-bill yields down.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka three, 12-month T-bill yields down.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lankan treasury bill yields were mixed at Tuesday's auction, with yields for three and 12-month bills falling by 0.07 and 0.05 percentage points and six-month yields increasing by 0.08 percentage points, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  Bids received   Bids accepted   Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months	 798		 798	  12.56 (12.63)</p>
<p>    6 months	 891		 686	  14.42 (14.34)</p>
<p>    12 months    1,453		 937	  15.21 (15.26)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets). -- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
